# KOC Reporting System Implementation Plan

## Goal Description
Build a premium-looking static HTML/CSS reporting system for KOC (Key Opinion Consumer) livestreams. The system will track revenue, ads performance, and KOC specific metrics.

## Proposed Changes

### Structure
We will create a multi-page static site.

#### [NEW] [index.html](file:///Users/kevin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/koc-report-system/index.html)
- The main Landing/Dashboard page.
- Contains the comprehensive metrics grid.

#### [NEW] [koc-management.html](file:///Users/kevin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/koc-report-system/koc-management.html)
- Page to add KOCs (Form + Upload).

#### [NEW] [data-upload.html](file:///Users/kevin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/koc-report-system/data-upload.html)
- Page to upload report Excel files.

#### [NEW] [koc-list.html](file:///Users/kevin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/koc-report-system/koc-list.html)
- List of all KOCs with summary stats.

#### [NEW] [koc-detail.html](file:///Users/kevin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/koc-report-system/koc-detail.html)
- Detailed view for a single KOC.

#### [NEW] [style.css](file:///Users/kevin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/koc-report-system/css/style.css)
- Global styles variables (Colors, Typography).
- Flexbox/Grid layouts.
- Premium aesthetics (Glassmorphism, gradients, inter font).

#### [NEW] [script.js](file:///Users/kevin/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/koc-report-system/js/script.js)
- Simple interactivity (Mobile menu toggle, dummy charts rendering if needed, date filter toggle UI states).

## Verification Plan
### Manual Verification
- Open `index.html` in browser.
- Verify all metric cards are present.
- Check navigation between pages.
- Verify "Add KOC" form layout.
- Check responsive behavior on mobile/desktop dimensions.
